<title>FRANCE: Worms &amp; Cie 1st-half net attrib up 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Worms &amp; Cie 1st-half net attrib up 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     573  vs	     426</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    Holding					  139  vs		62</p>
<p>    Insurance and financial services	 357  vs	     245</p>
<p>    Industry and industrial investment	77  vs	     119</p>
<p>    Net attributable per share (francs)  16.78  vs	   12.49</p>
<p>NOTE - The bank said in a results statement the 1995 figures were pro-forma to take account of the merger of Maison Worms and Worms &amp; Cie in June with effect retroactive to January 1.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
